{"slug":"Update_26.0","title":"Update 26.0","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"⚙️_Major_Changes","text":"⚙️ Major Changes","level":2},{"id":"🗺️_Maps","text":"🗺️ Maps","level":2},{"id":"🧪_UI_&_Quality_of_Life","text":"🧪 UI & Quality of Life","level":2},{"id":"v26.1","text":"v26.1","level":3},{"id":"v26.2","text":"v26.2","level":3},{"id":"v26.3","text":"v26.3","level":3},{"id":"v26.4","text":"v26.4","level":3},{"id":"v26.5","text":"v26.5","level":3},{"id":"v26.6","text":"v26.6","level":3}],"html":"<p><a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" class=\"\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront v.26.0</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> was released October 14, 2025.\n</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"📦_OpenFront_v26.0_Changelog\"><span id=\".F0.9F.93.A6_OpenFront_v26.0_Changelog\"></span>📦 <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" class=\"\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a> v26.0 Changelog</h1></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"⚙️_Major_Changes\"><span id=\".E2.9A.99.EF.B8.8F_Major_Changes\"></span>⚙️ Major Changes</h2></div>\n<ul><li>Improved <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nation</a> AI.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Railroad\" title=\"Railroad\">Train tracks</a> go over rivers.</li>\n<li>Added ability to capture territory from AFK teammates in team games.</li>\n<li>Added feature to delete unit.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"🗺️_Maps\"><span id=\".F0.9F.97.BA.EF.B8.8F_Maps\"></span>🗺️ Maps</h2></div>\n<ul><li>New Japan map</li>\n<li>New Montreal map</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"🧪_UI_&amp;_Quality_of_Life\"><span id=\".F0.9F.A7.AA_UI_.26_Quality_of_Life\"></span>🧪 UI &amp; Quality of Life</h2></div>\n<ul><li>New build menu</li>\n<li>Background music</li>\n<li>Redesign Player info overlay</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Minor_Releases\">Minor Releases</h1></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.1\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.1\" target=\"_blank\">v26.1</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.2\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.2\" target=\"_blank\">v26.2</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.3\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.3\" target=\"_blank\">v26.3</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.4\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.4\" target=\"_blank\">v26.4</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.5\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.5\" target=\"_blank\">v26.5</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v26.6\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.26.6\" target=\"_blank\">v26.6</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Update_23.0\" title=\"Update 23.0\">Update 23.0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Minor_Updates_of_23.x\" title=\"Minor Updates of 23.x\">Minor Updates of 23.x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Update_24.0_Beta\" title=\"Update 24.0 Beta\">Update 24.0 Beta</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Update_24.0\" title=\"Update 24.0\">Update 24.0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Update_25.0_Beta\" title=\"Update 25.0 Beta\">Update 25.0 Beta</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Update_History\" title=\"Update History\">Update History</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">Train</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Factory\" title